              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Pashuri mwene Imeri umuherezi, yar’ umubgiriza mukuru wo mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, yumvise Yeremiya avuze izo mbūri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.16.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 16:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 29:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.16.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 16:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aca aramukubita, amushira mu mpatane z’ibiti vyari ku kirimba gihera haruguru citwa ica Benyamini, kirora ku ngoro y’ Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Pashuri akūra Yeremiya mur’ izo mpatane. Maze Yeremiya aramubgira, at’ Uhoraho ntiyakwise Pashuri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pashuri risobanurwa ng’ Umutēkāno impande zose.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ariko yakwise Magori‐misabibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Magori‐misabibu risobanurwa ngw Ibikanga abantu impande zose.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 6:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ukw ari k’Uhoraho agize, ati Nzotuma wikanga, ukange na bagenzi bawe bose; bazohindikiranywa n’inkota z’abansi babo, nawe amaso yawe azovyibonera. Nzotanga Ubuyuda bgose mu kuboko kw’umwami w’i Babuloni, kand’ azobajana ar’ inyagano i Babuloni, kand’ azobicisha inkota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 20:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.13+2KI.25.14+2KI.25.15+2KI.25.16+2KI.25.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25:13-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikigeretseko nzotanga itunga ryose ry’iki gisagara, n’ivyar’ inyungu zaco, n’ivy’ igiciro vyaco vyose, mbere n’ibitayega vyose vy’abami b’i Buyuda, mbitange mu maboko y’abansi babo bazoba babanyaze, babafashe, babajanye i Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.14.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 14:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nawe, Pashuri, mwe n’abo mu rugo rwawe bose, muzojanwa kw inyagano: kand’ uzoshika i Babuloni, ni yo uzogwa, ni yo uzohambga, mwe na bagenzi bawe bose, abo warotoreye ivy’ ibinyoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
